OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the twins turning small-town 
OL,4,Adreams into a feature film             
OL,6,FTwin brothers who once spent years     
OL,7,Fchasing success in local bands are     
OL,8,Fturning those experiences into a       
OL,9,Ffeature film shot in the streets, pubs 
OL,10,Fand venues of their hometown.          
OL,12,FFilming is nearly complete on Small    
OL,13,FPond, an independent drama written and 
OL,14,Fdirected by Benji Parry and his twin   
OL,15,Fbrother Thom.                          
OL,17,FThe pair have drawn heavily on Evesham 
OL,18,Fand its music scene for a story about  
OL,19,Ffriendship, creativity and finding     
OL,20,Fpurpose when life does not quite go to 
OL,21,Fplan.                                  
